    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Reading and writing",
     "texto": [
      "**读** means to read aloud or to study a text; **看** means to look at or to read; **写**, to write; **听**, to listen. **汉字** are Chinese characters, and **字**, a character or letter.",
      "**作业** means homework and **考试**, exam. A **题** is an exam question or exercise; **问题** is usually a question or a problem."
     ],
